# Reproducibility.
#
# Two things in this repository depend on bytes not changing between one
# platform and another:
#
#   * the SHA-256 hashes in vendor/README.md, which tools/vendor.mjs --verify
#     checks and which CI runs before anything else — a checkout that rewrote
#     line endings would fail every one of them;
#   * index.html, which CI rebuilds and compares with `git diff --exit-code`
#     to prove it was not left stale.
#
# So the vendored bytes and the built artefact are never touched, and
# everything else is normalised to LF in the repository.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Never convert: these are either third-party artefacts we hash, or generated.
vendor/**   -text
index.html  -text

# Binary by nature.
*.pdf   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.xls   binary
*.gz    binary
*.wasm  binary
*.zip   binary
*.traineddata binary
